586
01:37:30.714 --> 01:37:32.714
Those people who came from the village together already knew each other.

587
01:37:32.714 --> 01:37:34.714
They were used to working together.

588
01:37:35.714 --> 01:37:36.714
It's not a coincidence, is it?

589
01:37:37.714 --> 01:37:38.714
It has been thought through.

