591
01:37:48.714 --> 01:37:51.714
For the people worked hard and were enthusiastic about it.

592
01:37:52.714 --> 01:37:53.714
That's fun building.

593
01:37:54.714 --> 01:37:55.714
Things are happening.

594
01:37:56.714 --> 01:37:57.714
We are making it happen.

595
01:37:58.714 --> 01:37:59.714
We see it growing.

596
01:37:59.714 --> 01:38:00.714
We see it growing.

