607
01:38:44.714 --> 01:38:45.714
Isn't that just terrorism?

608
01:38:46.714 --> 01:38:49.714
Isn't that just psychological warfare?

609
01:38:49.714 --> 01:38:50.714
Isn't that just psychological warfare?

610
01:38:51.714 --> 01:38:55.714
We're going to demoralize that whole bunch of weirdos.

611
01:38:56.714 --> 01:38:57.714
We'll show them a thing or two.

