And we always pray for the government, right?

731
01:48:31.714 --> 01:48:34.714
The Bible says, let us pray for those who are in authority over you.

732
01:48:36.714 --> 01:48:37.714
Pray for our plan.

733
01:48:38.714 --> 01:48:40.714
Pray that this...

734
01:48:41.714 --> 01:48:43.714
What is the right Dutch word?

735
01:48:45.714 --> 01:48:47.714
Do you know what we would like?

736
01:48:47.714 --> 01:48:50.714
That this building plan goes ahead.

737
01:48:51.714 --> 01:48:57.714
Because that facilitates us as a church to take the next steps.

738
01:49:08.714 --> 01:49:10.714
I find it a special time.

739
01:49:11.714 --> 01:49:13.714
I find it a very special time.

740
01:49:14.714 --> 01:49:21.714
We are just as much like the people who live in Jerusalem.

741
01:49:22.714 --> 01:49:25.714
They were busy with daily life.

742
01:49:26.714 --> 01:49:35.714
And in this story, their gaze was directed from their daily life to the great plan of God of which they are a part.

743
01:49:36.714 --> 01:49:42.714
And let us open our hearts to that change of mindset.

744
01:49:43.714 --> 01:49:45.714
For that change that we see.

745
01:49:46.714 --> 01:49:49.714
We are not just going to build a stone building.

746
01:49:50.714 --> 01:49:59.714
We are going to create a facility through which the congregation can develop, flourish, and become visible.

747
01:50:00.714 --> 01:50:03.714
For it is the congregation of Jesus that you and I are together.

748
01:50:03.714 --> 01:50:06.714
In that, God wants to reveal Himself.

749
01:50:09.714 --> 01:50:13.714
Shall we, like Nehemiah, open our hearts?

750
01:50:14.714 --> 01:50:19.714
To truly be motivated from our hearts.

751
01:50:20.714 --> 01:50:25.714
Let us open our hearts so that it is the Holy Spirit who places that vision in our hearts.

752
01:50:26.714 --> 01:50:31.714
To see that this is a part and how this is a part of the greater plan of God.

753
01:50:31.714 --> 01:50:38.714
In this region, we as a church have a responsibility to bring the gospel.

754
01:50:39.714 --> 01:50:42.714
And that is not just words but also to be the gospel.

755
01:50:43.714 --> 01:50:48.714
Let us as a church embrace, grow, and cherish that vision.

756
01:50:49.714 --> 01:50:50.714
Amen.

757
01:51:01.714 --> 01:51:02.714
MUSIC.

758
01:51:31.714 --> 01:51:38.714
SUNG HOLY, HOLY, HOLY.

759
01:52:01.714 --> 01:52:09.714
SUNG HOLY, HOLY, HOLY.

760
01:52:31.714 --> 01:52:38.714
SUNG HOLY, HOLY, HOLY.

761
01:53:01.714 --> 01:53:08.714
SUNG HOLY, HOLY, HOLY.

762
01:53:31.714 --> 01:53:41.714
SUNG HOLY, HOLY, HOLY, HOLY.

763
01:53:41.754 --> 01:53:45.594
Thank you, Bram, for the sermon, I really enjoyed it.

764
01:53:45.634 --> 01:53:51.154
It is great to see how you can carry out God's plans,

765
01:53:51.194 --> 01:53:55.994
but still work in a very thorough and good manner.

766
01:53:56.034 --> 01:54:00.034
And not only in this sermon, but also in your entire functioning in the church,

767
01:54:00.114 --> 01:54:04.234
in the finances and the construction project, you are a good example for us.

768
01:54:04.274 --> 01:54:07.834
Just as we built all year, you are also contributing to this church.

769
01:54:07.874 --> 01:54:10.234
Thank you for that.

770
01:54:10.274 --> 01:54:13.274
APPLAUSE.

771
01:54:14.954 --> 01:54:21.994
So the sign with the yellow placard from the congregation is now at the front of the driveway,

772
01:54:22.034 --> 01:54:27.914
which announces to the surroundings that we have building plans.

773
01:54:27.994 --> 01:54:35.874
It is good to see that sign when you drive by to say a quick prayer.

774
01:54:35.914 --> 01:54:40.274
And I would like to pray for that together with you now.

775
01:54:40.314 --> 01:54:45.354
I thank you sincerely that you are with this congregation,

776
01:54:45.394 --> 01:54:49.674
that you have placed this congregation as a lighthouse in the Kempen.

777
01:54:49.714 --> 01:54:54.634
I thank you for your love and your compassion for the Kempen,

778
01:54:54.634 --> 01:55:01.034
that you were moved for Israel and Judah and Jerusalem,

779
01:55:01.074 --> 01:55:04.714
that that was the place where your people lived.

780
01:55:04.754 --> 01:55:10.434
May the Kempen also be the place where your people live and where you are honored.

781
01:55:10.474 --> 01:55:15.834
And I thank you that we can function here as your congregation, as your ambassador.

782
01:55:15.874 --> 01:55:20.954
I thank you that we grow and flourish through your love and grace.

783
01:55:20.994 --> 01:55:29.754
We especially want to know you spiritually and help more people towards you.

784
01:55:29.794 --> 01:55:33.754
We also want to grow practically here with this construction project.

785
01:55:33.794 --> 01:55:39.954
And here we need, just as Nehemiah needed the favor of the king,

786
01:55:39.994 --> 01:55:45.434
we also need the favor of the congregation to be able to build here.

787
01:55:45.474 --> 01:55:50.594
Lord, and I pray that you grant us favor with the government.

788
01:55:50.594 --> 01:55:56.194
Lord, that the construction project as a whole, as we would like it,

789
01:55:56.234 --> 01:56:02.194
inspired by your spirit, will be approved, so that we may get to work.

790
01:56:02.234 --> 01:56:04.794
And I thank you, Lord, as Bram expressed,

791
01:56:04.834 --> 01:56:08.554
you are the God who is spirit above praying and understanding.

792
01:56:08.594 --> 01:56:10.274
And we look forward, Lord.

793
01:56:10.314 --> 01:56:15.994
Lord, we do not want to just take our own corner in this area,

794
01:56:16.034 --> 01:56:20.114
in this city of Lommel, Lord, we want to be visible.

795
01:56:20.114 --> 01:56:23.874
That you are visible, Lord, that the congregation is visible,

796
01:56:23.914 --> 01:56:26.154
Lord, so that people will find you.

797
01:56:26.194 --> 01:56:28.674
So grant us favor in this place, Lord.

798
01:56:28.714 --> 01:56:32.834
Grant us favor with this government, in Jesus' name.

799
01:56:32.874 --> 01:56:34.914
Hallelujah.

800
01:56:34.954 --> 01:56:40.114
What I also found really cool, you always have in a sermon and so

801
01:56:40.154 --> 01:56:42.994
that certain things speak to you specifically.

802
01:56:43.034 --> 01:56:47.274
And for me, today it was the prayer of Nehemiah,

803
01:56:47.274 --> 01:56:51.354
who always seeks God before he does anything.

804
01:56:51.394 --> 01:56:54.154
And that is very good if you as a congregation do that.

805
01:56:54.194 --> 01:56:59.194
And Tim and Vanessa together with us are not just doing something,

806
01:56:59.234 --> 01:57:03.194
but we are earnestly seeking God to know where we should go.

807
01:57:03.234 --> 01:57:06.874
And also for your personal life, that is very important.

808
01:57:06.914 --> 01:57:12.114
In all the plans you may have, make sure you do it together with God.

809
01:57:12.234 --> 01:57:19.034
And one of my favorite verses about that is in Proverbs 3 verses.

810
01:57:19.074 --> 01:57:21.314
In the old MBG translation it says,

811
01:57:21.354 --> 01:57:24.874
acknowledge Him in all your ways and He will make your paths straight.

812
01:57:24.914 --> 01:57:29.234
And in the Basisbijbel it is also beautifully translated.

813
01:57:29.274 --> 01:57:35.114
It says, consult all your plans with Him, with God.

814
01:57:35.154 --> 01:57:37.954
Then He will guide your life.

815
01:57:38.034 --> 01:57:42.074
It is so important like Nehemiah.

816
01:57:42.114 --> 01:57:47.234
First go pray, first seek God, even for 4 months long.

817
01:57:47.274 --> 01:57:49.354
Pray, pray, pray.

818
01:57:49.394 --> 01:57:53.874
Do that in the congregation, but also do that for your personal life.

819
01:57:53.914 --> 01:57:57.194
And then you will get that when you face opposition,

820
01:57:57.234 --> 01:58:01.794
as Bram just pointed out at the end of Nehemiah 2,

821
01:58:01.834 --> 01:58:05.234
where some leaders are rising up.

822
01:58:05.234 --> 01:58:08.674
And what are you doing here, they say to Nehemiah.

823
01:58:08.714 --> 01:58:12.874
And what are you rebelling against the king for and so on.

824
01:58:12.914 --> 01:58:16.514
That is Nehemiah's answer.

825
01:58:16.554 --> 01:58:23.274
But I answered, the God of heaven will ensure that we succeed.

826
01:58:23.314 --> 01:58:30.794
And you can say that with confidence when you involve God in everything you do.

827
01:58:31.434 --> 01:58:36.234
So build your life around Him and discuss all things with Him.

828
01:58:36.274 --> 01:58:41.514
And we also have a beautiful prayer for, may I have that on the screen?

829
01:58:41.554 --> 01:58:45.554
Maybe you don't know God very well yet or not at all.

830
01:58:45.594 --> 01:58:49.514
Or maybe this is a very beautiful moment to choose,

831
01:58:49.554 --> 01:58:55.154
to dedicate your life to Him again and to involve Him in everything you do.

832
01:58:55.194 --> 01:58:57.674
Would you like to pray with me?

833
01:58:57.714 --> 01:58:59.594
Thank you, Jesus.

834
01:58:59.634 --> 01:59:02.514
I believe that you are the Son of God.

835
01:59:02.554 --> 01:59:06.594
I believe that you died on the cross for my sin.

836
01:59:06.634 --> 01:59:09.034
Forgive me all my mistakes.

837
01:59:09.074 --> 01:59:12.274
I invite you into my life, Jesus.

838
01:59:12.314 --> 01:59:14.394
Give me a new start.

839
01:59:14.434 --> 01:59:16.874
Help me to live for you.

840
01:59:16.914 --> 01:59:19.834
From today on, I am a child of God.

841
01:59:19.874 --> 01:59:20.994
Amen.

842
01:59:21.034 --> 01:59:24.154
Really, live with Jesus. He is worth everything.

843
01:59:24.194 --> 01:59:28.354
He loves you and only wants the best for you.

844
01:59:28.394 --> 01:59:31.714
Have a wonderful week. Do it together with God.

845
01:59:31.754 --> 01:59:36.074
In a few days, the registration forms for all camps will close.

846
01:59:36.114 --> 01:59:40.514
So if you haven't signed up yet, last chance, do it today.

847
01:59:40.554 --> 01:59:42.554
Wishing everyone a great few weeks.

848
01:59:58.354 --> 02:00:00.434
***
